-- tests/mocks/gc.wowlua
-- wowlua 0.9.1 workaround (Docs/wowlua-0.9.1-report.md, C40): building the
-- coverage report reads string constants of compiled functions the garbage
-- collector may already have freed ("stale handle" panic). Mocks load after
-- Blizzard's UI and before SuuUI, so with the automatic GC stopped here no
-- collection runs while SuuUI and the tests run. Remove once wowlua is fixed.
collectgarbage("stop")
